message: "If you use this code in your research, please cite the paper below."
title: "RENE: Rank adapt tENsor dEcomposition"
abstract: >-
  PyTorch implementation of a unified framework for compressing pre-trained
  neural networks by simultaneously applying tensor decomposition (TT, CP) and
  optimized rank selection under a composite compression loss.
